B.Lb=new A.ad(B.fp,["How long does it take to build a custom application?","Depending on the complexity, a standard MVP (Minimum Viable Product) typically takes 8-12 weeks. Large-scale enterprise systems can take 4-6 months. We work in 2-week Agile sprints, ensuring you see continuous progress."],t.w)
B.La=new A.ad(B.fp,["What is your pricing model?","We offer flexible pricing. For well-defined projects, we provide fixed-price contracts. For long-term or evolving projects, we offer time-and-materials or dedicated team retainers."],t.w)
B.Ld=new A.ad(B.fp,["Will I own the source code?","Absolutely. Once the project is completed and fully paid for, the intellectual property and all source code are entirely transferred to you. We believe in transparency and fairness."],t.w)
B.L9=new A.ad(B.fp,["Do you provide maintenance and support after launch?","Yes, we offer comprehensive post-launch support and SLA-based maintenance packages. This includes server monitoring, security patching, library upgrades, and bug fixes to ensure your app scales smoothly."],t.w)
B.Lc=new A.ad(B.fp,["How do we communicate during the project?","We set up a dedicated Slack/Discord channel for real-time communication, provide weekly demo calls via Google Meet/Zoom, and grant you full view access to our Jira/Trello boards so you can track every task."],t.w)
